        <footnote id="F1">The 315,000 shares of common stock are held by Falcons I, LLC. The sole member of Falcons I, LLC is Angel Oak Asset Management Holdings, LLC. The sole member of Angel Oak Asset Management Holdings, LLC is Angel Oak Companies, LP, which is a wholly-owned subsidiary of Angel Oak Companies, LLC (AOC). Mr. Fierman is a 20.45% stockholder of AOC through various vehicles and, accordingly, may be deemed to be the beneficial owner of the shares held by Falcons I, LLC. Mr. Fierman disclaims beneficial ownership of the shares of common stock held by Falcons I, LLC, except to the extent of his pecuniary interest therein.</footnote>
